{"id": "86329", "name": "אי-שוויון עם ערך מוחלט – |x − a| ≥ b, איחוד קרניים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following inequality:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ |{{CT:0}}| \\ge {{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as <code dir=\"ltr\">x&gt;=5</code> and/or <code dir=\"ltr\">x&lt;13</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Use \\(|u|\\ge b \\iff u\\ge b\\) or \\(u\\le -b\\) (for \\(b&gt;0\\)). This gives two simple inequalities joined with or (a union of two rays).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Removing the absolute value</b><br>As<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ |{{CT:0}}| \\ge {{CT:1}}. \\]</p>Then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\ge {{CT:1}} \\mbox{ or } {{CT:0}} \\le -{{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Isolating x</b><br>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}} \\ge {{CT:1}} +{{CT:3}} \\mbox{ or } {{CT:2}} \\le -{{CT:1}}+{{CT:3}}. \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}} \\ge {{CT:4}} \\mbox{ or } {{CT:2}} \\le {{CT:5}}. \\]</p>This can be entered as \\({{CT:2}} &lt;= {{CT:6}}\\) or \\({{CT:2}} &gt;= {{CT:7}}\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "n1", "n2", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}